WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.009
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with communities

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:05.811
across Africa.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:09.411
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm.

00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:13.347
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction.

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:19.621
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space. Explain one

00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:22.958
respectful similarity or difference with another African example.
